Listed all Combos that affect: 

*Starting Money: Wallet starts with extra cash at the beginning of the stage.
*Research Power: Unit recharge time.
*Accounting Power: Money gained when defeating an enemy.
*Study Power: XP gained from beating the level.
*Worker Cat Start Level: The initial level Worker Cat starts with at the beginning of the stage.
*Worker Cat Max: Wallet capacity increased at max level Worker Cat.
*Worker Cat Speed: May be an unused effect.
*Cost Down: Unit deploy cost.